Maps:
- maps/third-age.jpg, and the path data in data/shapes-svg.js: k1tesurfen (mapome),
  CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
- maps/beleriand.jpg and maps/beleriand-aged.jpg: Starcave / Hope Maps, CC BY-SA 3.0,
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/
- maps/numenor.jpg, maps/gondor.jpg, maps/shire.jpg, maps/valinor.jpg and icons/*.png:
  generated with Gemini for this project. Numenor follows the layout of Shelly Shapiro's map
  in Unfinished Tales; Gondor and the Shire follow Christopher Tolkien's maps in The Lord of
  the Rings; no license is claimed over those layouts.
- fonts/*.woff2: IM Fell English and IM Fell DW Pica SC by Igino Marini, SIL Open Font
  License 1.1.

